- **UnitTypes**: An array containing objects that represent each unit type.

    - **UnitTypeID**: A unique identifier for the unit type.

    - **Name**: The name of the unit type.


This response format allows clients to easily parse and utilize the information about unit types.

This endpoint retrieves a list of unit types available in the system.
